Read AGENTS.md before editing. It is the shared source of project conventions.
Read docs/agent-patterns.md for TanStack Start Server Functions, Convex authorization,
Better Auth plugins, shadcn/ui and the quality commands.
For a new product, read docs/project-start.md and recommend personal or organization
ownership based on its data. Preserve the existing mode, secrets and data.
Run the checks appropriate to the change. Never claim checks that were not executed.
